OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with a few
OL,6,Fbright intervals and the chance of a
OL,7,Ffew scattered drizzly showers. Still
OL,8,Ffeeling rather cool with a light
OL,9,Fnorthwesterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA largely cloudy evening with
OL,12,Fthe chance of a few light drizzly
OL,13,Fshowers, mainly across Orkney. Any
OL,14,Fshowers will gradually fade, leaving
OL,15,Fthe rest of the night dry but cloudy.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FDry during daytime with some
OL,18,Fsunny spells for Shetland, but mainly
OL,19,Fcloudy for Orkney. Winds will be
OL,20,Flight, but strengthening in the
OL,21,Fevening ahead of overnight rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
