OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FChangeable and often windy, with
OL,7,Fshowers or longer spells of rain.
OL,8,FStaying quite cool for the time of
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
